## Unify application tabs as underline rails

Context: Application tabs used a heavy rounded container and filled active
state, while KG Explorer and generated side panels maintained separate visual
implementations. The redesign establishes one lightweight, responsive tab
language for page, card, modal, and constrained panel contexts.

Changes:

1. `src/front/static/global/css/components.css`
   Replaced the fused rounded `.ob-tabs` treatment with a transparent,
   horizontally scrollable underline rail, added the shared compact density,
   and switched inactive hover to the brand-aware primary tint.
2. `src/front/static/global/css/main.css`
   Aligned legacy Bootstrap tab fallbacks to the standard density and restored
